10H20EG8.PDS    EXAMPLE OF 10H20EG8 BOOLEAN EQUATION FILE       PAL10H20EG8

23S8.PDS        EXAMPLE OF 23S8 BOOLEAN EQUATION FILE	        PAL23S8.

